sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Key as Authenticator (YubiKey)
    participant Browser as Client (React + @simplewebauthn)
    participant Backend as Axum Backend (webauthn-rs)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    User->>Browser: Enter username (optional) & Login
    Browser->>Backend: POST /api/auth/login/start {username}
    Backend->>DB: Fetch user credentials (or all if username empty)
    DB-->>Backend: Return registered passkeys
    Backend->>Backend: webauthn.start_passkey_authentication(...)
    Backend-->>Browser: Return RequestChallengeResponse (RCR)<br/>Set-Cookie: webauthn_auth_state (Encrypted)

    Browser->>Key: startAuthentication(rcr) via WebAuthn API
    User->>Key: Touch YubiKey / PIN verification
    Key->>Key: Sign Challenge with Private Key
    Key-->>Browser: Return PublicKeyCredential (Assertion)

    Browser->>Backend: POST /api/auth/login/finish {PublicKeyCredential}<br/>Cookie: webauthn_auth_state
    Backend->>Backend: Decrypt cookie & extract PasskeyAuthentication
    Backend->>Backend: webauthn.finish_passkey_authentication(...)
    Backend->>DB: Query user_id by cred_id_b64
    DB-->>Backend: Return user_id
    Backend-->>Browser: HTTP 200 OK<br/>Set-Cookie: webauthn_session<br/>Clear-Cookie: webauthn_auth_state
    Browser->>User: Authentication Success & User Logged In
